Welcome to the MetaWINDOW graphic environment!
This demo program will take you on a quick tour 
of the MetaWINDOW graphics library.

MetaWINDOW, which is written and optimized in
assembly code, has a rich set of over 200
functions. Combine this functionality with
high-performance, and you have THE graphics
toolkit of the 90's!

  [space bar]        - PAUSE and RESUME

  [Escape]           - QUIT TO DOS

  any other key  or 
  mouse button      - Stops demo
